; AO Extremum v1.31 MASTER FRIDAY - 100K FundingPips test candidate
; Purpose: measure the real cost of mandatory Friday force-flat.
; Broker/server times. FundingPips support stated Friday close near 23:59 server time.
; This set blocks new baskets all Friday, blocks new grid legs from 18:00,
; and force-closes the whole account at 22:30 with repeated retries.
